# Code style

Match the file you are in. Don't restyle a file as a side effect of a fix.

- Two-space indent, semicolons, `const` and `let`.
- Prettier is set to single quotes, semicolons, and a 90 character line (`.prettierrc`). Server files mostly follow that. `src/client/board.js` is still double quotes. Don't "fix" the whole client in an unrelated change.
- No new framework, no second data store, no auth bolted on.
- Prefer the helpers that already exist (`shapeBug`, `comparePriority`) over a one-off copy in the route.
